Thamizh.ai

The Tirukkuṟaḷ is in the public domain. The digital text used here was
compiled by comparing five open editions; see data/sources/README.md for
their names and licences (Apache-2.0 and MIT).

Translations, word glosses and explanations on the site are generated by AI
(Gemini on Google Cloud Vertex AI) and are labelled as such.

Kuṟuntokai and Puṟanāṉūṟu: the Tamil text is from Project Madurai
(https://www.projectmadurai.org/), an open, voluntary initiative preparing
electronic texts of Tamil literary works.
  Kuṟuntokai (pm0110): etext preparation and web version by
    Dr. K. Kalyanasundaram; proofreading by Ms. Sarala Sandirasegarane.
  Puṟanāṉūṟu (pm0057): etext preparation by the staff and students of
    K.A.P. Viswanatham Higher Secondary School, Tiruchirappalli; web version
    by Dr. K. Kalyanasundaram.
The header page of each etext is kept intact in data/sources/projectmadurai/,
as Project Madurai's terms ask. Modern titles, editor's notes and editorial
punctuation are not shown.
